    -- Policy settings that limit the number of game sessions an individual player can create
    -- over a span of time.
    ResourceCreationLimitPolicy: ResourceCreationLimitPolicy
    -- The name of a metric group to add this fleet to. Use a metric group in Amazon
    -- CloudWatch to aggregate the metrics from multiple fleets. Provide an existing metric
    -- group name, or create a new metric group by providing a new name. A fleet can only be in
    -- one metric group at a time.
    MetricGroups: {string}
    -- Amazon GameLift Servers Anywhere configuration options.
